  "details": "VRChat worlds need an official, sandboxed WebSocket client API for real-time data.\n\nCurrently, worlds can download text with VRCStringDownloader.LoadUrl, but string downloads are rate-limited. This makes HTTP polling workable for weather, but not ideal for time-sensitive data such as earthquake early warnings, transit status, live event schedules, multiplayer dashboards, and moderation/control systems. VRChat String Loading documentation",
